  "note": "Family F4 (2026-10-22): a fixed corpus of intents per app kind for ssam_discover, written from the audit of an O11 Traditional migration (a Traditional request sent to the prototype importer, the Reactive ui.dropdown recipe for a Traditional ComboBox, an operation-history question answered with forms and dropdowns). Each item names its lane, the kind it is for and how that kind is known: by the words of the intent (from: intent) or by the capture the call names (from: capture, moduleType = the module type the capture holds; the test answers the flow probe of the module map with it). expect.top lists the capabilities a correct first direct match may be; expect.none means no proven recipe exists for the kind (the answer must say so and give the native path); expect.tools lists the read tools a question must lead with (no capability at all). The labels are written by hand: forbid (sets below or ids) lists what must never appear in the answer (any tier), osui the OutSystems UI app types allowed; the scorer judges only with these labels (discover-kind-score.mjs), never with the filter's declarations.",
